      "PIA\nInflight\nMotion Picture\nSchedule\nfrom\n6th May to 22nd July\n1962",
      "6TH MAY to 22ND JULY 1962\nDATE\nSECTOR\nAPRIL 30-MAY 6 NEW YORK-LONDON / LONDON-NEW YORK\nAPRIL 30-MAY 6 KARACHI-LONDON / LONDON-KARACHI.\nMAY 7-13\nNEW YORK-LONDON / LONDON-NEW YORK\nMAY 7-13\nKARACHI-LONDON / LONDON-KARACHI\nMAY 14-20\nNEW YORK-LONDON / LONDON-NEW YORK\nMAY 14-20\nKARACHI-LONDON / LONDON-KARACHI\nMAY 21-27\nNEW YORK-LONDON / LONDON-NEW YORK\nMAY 21-27 KARACHI-LONDON / LONDON-KARACHI\nMAY 28—JUNE 3 NEW YORK-LONDON / LONDON-NEW YORK\nMAY 28—JUNE 3 KARACHI-LONDON / LONDON-KARACHI\nJUNE 4-10\nNEW YORK-LONDON / LONDON-NEW YORK\nJUNE 410\nKARACHI-LONDON / LONDON-KARACHI\nJUNE 11-17\nNEW YORK-LONDON / LONDON-NEW YORK\nJUNE 11-17\nKARACHI-LONDON / LONDON-KARACHI\nJUNE 18-24\nNEW YORK-LONDON / LONDON-NEW YORK\nJUNE 18-24\nKARACHI-LONDON / LONDON-KARACHI\nJUNE 25-JULY | NEW YORK-LONDON / LONDON-NEW YORK\nJUNE 25—JULY | KARACHI-LONDON / LONDON-KARACHI\nJULY 2-8\nNEW YORK-LONDON / LONDON-NEW YORK\nJULY 2-8\nKARACHI-LONDON / LONDON-KARACHI\n• JULY 9-15\nNEW YORK-LONDON / LONDON-NEW YORK\nJULY 9-15\nKARACHI-LONDON / LONDON-KARACHI\nJULY 16-22\nNEW. YORK-LONDON / LONDON-NEW YORK\nJULY 16-22\nKARACHI-LONDON / LONDON-KARACHI\nFILM\nSUMMER AND SMOKE\nColor\nLIGHT IN THE PIAZZA\nColor\nLIGHT IN THE PIAZZA\nColor\nSUMMER AND SMOKE\nColor\nVIEW FROM THE BRIDGE\n-\nSERGENTS THREE\nColor\nSERGENTS THREE\nColor\nVIEW FROM THE BRIDGE\nWORLD IN MY POCKET\n-\nSATAN NEVER SLEEPS\nColor\nSATAN NEVER SLEEPS\nColor\nWORLD IN MY POCKET -\nSWEET BIRD OF YOUTH\nColor\nFOLLOW THAT DREAM\nColor\nFOLLOW THAT DREAM\nColor\nSWEET BIRD OF YOUTH\nColor\nAROLD LLOYD'S WORLD -\nOF COMED\nEXPERIMENT IN TERROR -\nEXPERIMENT IN TERROR\n-\nHAROLD LLOYD'S WORLD\nOF COMEDY\n.-\nMAN WHO SHOT LIBERTY\nVALANCE\nSTATE FAIR\nColor\nSTATE FAIR\nColor\nMAN WHO SHOT LIBERTY\nVALANCE\nSTARRING\nLaurence Harvey and\nGeraldine Page.\nOlivia de Havilland\nand Rossano Brazzi.\nOlivia de Havilland\nand Rossano Brazzi.\nLaurence Harvey and\nGeraldine Page.\nRaf Vallone and\nCarol Lawrence.\nFrank Sinatra and\nDean Martin.\nFrank Sinatra and\nDean Martin.\nRaf Vallone and\nCarol Lawrence.\nRod Steiger and\nNadja Tiller.\nWm. Holden and\nClifton Webb.\nWm. Holden and\nClifton Webb.\nRod Steiger and\nNadja Tiller.\nPaul Newman and\nGeraldine Page.\nElvis Presley and\nArthur O'Connell.\nElvis Presley and\nArthur O'Connell.\nPaul Newman and\nGeraldine Page.\nHarold Lloyd.\nGlenn Ford and\nLee Remick.\nGlenn Ford and\nLee Remick.\nHarold Lloyd.\nJohn Wayne and\nJames Stewart.\nPat Boone and\nPamela Tiffin.\nPat Boone and\nPamela Tiffin.\nJohn Wayne and\nJames Stewart."
